`,o.jsx(t.p,{children:"Two years ago, right before I flew out to visit friends in Australia and Malaysia, I remember sitting in a cafe, thinking: what gift do I bring?"}),`
`,o.jsx(t.p,{children:"I wanted to take a touch of Nepal but not a cliché option. But I overthought every option, and at the last minute, just grabbed pashmina shawls."}),`
`,o.jsx(t.p,{children:"For an Australian summer!"}),`
`,o.jsx(t.p,{children:"Ugh, sorry Cath."}),`
`,o.jsx(t.p,{children:"It felt like I was giving a gift for the sake of giving one, with no real thought behind it. And that's not how I like to give gifts. I like them to feel personal."}),`
`,o.jsx(t.p,{children:"Since that trip, every time I wander around Kathmandu, I notice things that instantly strike me as perfect souvenir gifts. Exactly the kind I wish I'd found back when I was stressing over what to buy. So instead of letting that knowledge sit uselessly in my head, here's my running list of the best gifts from Nepal. Most of them come from small Nepali brands that deserve far more attention than they get."}),`
