`,o.jsx(t.p,{children:"With several branches around the city, Chiyaspot is a hangout spot for tea lovers. You'll often see a group balancing a Jenga tower while sipping tea. I love their seating options. You can even sit on the floor, which is perfect for board games."}),`
`,o.jsx(t.h3,{children:"Mellow Bakeshop"}),`
