`,o.jsx(t.p,{children:"This is your stop if you want the best cheesecake in town while playing a round of a Nepali board game. Their game collection is small, but if you have a sweet tooth and a soft spot for games, Mellow is worth the trip."}),`
`,o.jsx(t.h3,{children:"Khushi Coffee House"}),`
